It's noteworthy to explicitly mention that there are drawbacks if
you don't travel unburdened, and severe drawbacks the higher your
encumbrance is. Most apparently; you get slower, so you can't any
more outrun some monsters that you could before, and all monsters
hit you more often. Less apparent; you won't regenerate PW and HPs
as fast (or at all) depending on your encumbrance level. At some
point you even *lose* HPs (life points) as I recently observed by
accident.

